#showas:Zenith 竞技场
This scenario demonstrates the personality of the Zenith Architrave. The Gladiator AI (difficulty 7) has integrated ZA ships and will heavily prefer using them.

There are four Zenith Architrave factions (all intensity 5) that start on their own homeworld. These ZA's will all seek to take control of their territory, the size differing between the ZA (scouting the ZA will let you see their respective territory planet-count in the in-game menu).

The ZA's are normally content with stopping their expansion once they meet their goal. But they will occasionally grow ambitious and announce pioneers that aim to expand beyond. The other ZA's will take great offense to a ZA that expands beyond its allotted territory and spark massive Civil Wars until the transgressor is pushed back. These civil wars are extremely dangerous and best avoided altogether until they settle down.